# Development test flow for SmartLost.MatchingService.Api (mock photo and AI adapters).
# Compose: http://localhost:8081   Local dotnet run: http://localhost:5049
@host = http://localhost:8081
@source = 10000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 1. Reset all Matching rows and seed the demo scenario
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/seed

### 2. Suggestions before embeddings exist: metadata-only relevance, VisualSimilarity is null
POST {{host}}/api/matching/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-before-embeddings

{ "listingId": "{{source}}", "expectedSourceRevision": 1 }

### 3. Prepare embeddings (mock DINOv3) for the source and the two photo candidates
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/listings/{{source}}/embedding/process
X-Correlation-ID: demo-embed-source

###
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/listings/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/embedding/process
X-Correlation-ID: demo-embed-candidate-1

###
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/listings/20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/embedding/process
X-Correlation-ID: demo-embed-candidate-2

### 4. Suggestions with visual evidence: candidate 1 ~1.0, candidate 2 ~0.5
POST {{host}}/api/matching/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-with-embeddings

{ "listingId": "{{source}}", "expectedSourceRevision": 1 }

### 5. Profiling: slow AI call (warning event 1304), timeout (1303 TimedOut) and failure (1303 Failed)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/listings/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001/embedding/process
X-Correlation-ID: demo-slow-ai

###
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/listings/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002/embedding/process
X-Correlation-ID: demo-timeout-ai

###
POST {{host}}/api/matching/demo/listings/30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003/embedding/process
X-Correlation-ID: demo-error-ai

### 6. Statuses: Pending (expected revision ahead), Conflict (expected revision behind), Unavailable (ineligible source)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listingId": "{{source}}", "expectedSourceRevision": 2 }

###
POST {{host}}/api/matching/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listingId": "30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001", "expectedSourceRevision": 1 }

### 7. Validation failure is profiled as Failed with matching.listing_id_required
POST {{host}}/api/matching/suggestions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "listingId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000", "expectedSourceRevision": 0 }

### 8. Mock Qwen photo analysis of the source photo (photo IDs: listing ID with the second group set to f0f0)
POST {{host}}/api/matching/photo-analysis
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-analysis

{ "listingId": "{{source}}", "photoId": "10000000-f0f0-0000-0000-000000000001", "photoRevision": 1 }

### 9. Last 10 Matching log entries, newest first (count: 1-100)
GET {{host}}/api/matching/demo/logs

###
GET {{host}}/api/matching/demo/logs?count=3
